# WinUI XAML language service:
#   - exclude the C# server sources + build output and the test harness/fixtures
#   - the published server (dist/server, produced by `bundle:server`) is NOT excluded and ships in the VSIX
#   - trim runtime-irrelevant publish artifacts (debug symbols and XML doc comments). The apphost
#     WinUiXaml.LanguageServer.exe and Roslyn BuildHost executables are required at runtime.
#   - package-vsc.ps1 asserts both architecture-specific apphosts are present in the VSIX.
server/**
test/**
.vscode-test.mjs
server-test.log
dist/server/**/*.pdb
dist/server/**/*.xml
winapp.yaml
